{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# L=2: do the $L=1$ SoV-basis operators localize on site 1 when acting on the twist-$w$ vacuum?\n\nCompanion frame, chain twist $G_c(z)$ with $\\chi=(4,11,-30)$ ($z=(2,-3,5)$), point 1: $h=\\tfrac13$, $\\theta=(\\tfrac27,-\\tfrac5{11})$. Vacuum $\\langle v_g|=(\\mathrm{lw}^Tg)^{\\otimes 2}$, $g=e^{r_1E_{21}}e^{r_2E_{31}}e^{r_3E_{32}}$, with $r(w)=(-1/w_1,\\,1/(w_1w_2),\\,-(w_1+w_2)/(w_1w_2))$, so that it is the reference state for twist $G_c(w)$ (\\nb{main-notes.tex}, \\nb{transfer-algebra-dim.wb}).\n\nOperators (from \\nb{Companion-B-general-rep.wb}, the left $B$-eigenbasis at $L=1$): $O_\\mu=\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{11},0}(\\theta_1)\\,\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}(\\theta_1)^{-1}\\,\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{21},\\mu_{12}}(\\theta_1)$, now two-site with the chain twist, fused $\\mathbb T_\\lambda$ via CBR. Question: is $\\langle v_g|O_\\mu=\\langle a|\\otimes\\langle\\mathrm{lw}^Tg|$?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n  ps[rep] = \n   Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #] & /@ (Tuples[\n          Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, \n            Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]))}, \n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, \n     Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := \n  J0[k][pat] = \n   Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := \n  Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[\n     Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, \n         Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n         Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n       ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := \n  Jm[k][pat] = \n   Sum[Product[\n       pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n      Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, \n        Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[\n      ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := \n  JJ[k, l, rep] = \n   Which[k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]], l == k + 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l == k - 1, \n    Transpose[\n     Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ \n       ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]], l > k + 1, \n    JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep], l < k - 1, \n    JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - \n     JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* point 1, chain twist chi(z), vacuum twist w; names hh/th/rFromW avoid clashing with other notebooks' globals in the shared kernel *)\nhh = 1/3; th = {2/7, -5/11};\nGz = {{4, 11, -30}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nClearAll[companion, rFromW];\ncompanion[w_] := {{Total[w], -(w[[1]] w[[2]] + w[[1]] w[[3]] + w[[2]] w[[3]]), Times @@ w}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nrFromW[w_] := {-1/w[[1]], 1/(w[[1]] w[[2]]), -(w[[1]] + w[[2]])/(w[[1]] w[[2]])};\n(* two-site monodromy, site 1 = left Kronecker factor, twist on the right; sparse *)\nClearAll[E2, Ls, Tu, TGm, qm, tMat];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep2]];\nLs[i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - hh E2[j, i];\nTu[{i_, j_}][u_] := Tu[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[Ls[i, k][u - th[[1]]], Ls[k, j][u - th[[2]]]], {k, 3}];\nTGm[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGm[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[Tu[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\n(* quantum minor, k-th factor at u + h - k h (as in the L=1 notebooks) *)\nqm[Gm_][Ii_][u_] := Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[TGm[Gm][{p[[k]], Ii[[k]]}][u + hh - k hh], {k, Length[Ii]}]), {p, Permutations[Ii]}];\n(* antisymmetric t_a; 1 for a = 0, 0 outside 1..3 *)\ntMat[Gm_][a_][u_] := tMat[Gm][a][u] = Which[a == 0, IdentityMatrix[d2^2, SparseArray], a < 0 || a > 3, SparseArray[{}, {d2^2, d2^2}], True, Sum[qm[Gm][Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\nconjP[lam_] := Table[Count[lam, x_ /; x >= j], {j, 1, Max[lam, 0]}];\n(* CBR terms of T_lam(u): list of {sign, {a_1..a_l1}}; factor i at u + h (i-1); drop terms with a vanishing factor *)\ncbrTerms[lam_] := With[{l1 = Max[lam, 0], lp = conjP[lam]}, Select[Table[{Signature[p], Table[lp[[p[[i]]]] + i - p[[i]], {i, l1}]}, {p, Permutations[Range[l1]]}], AllTrue[#[[2]], 0 <= # <= 3 &] &]];\n(* covector action w . T_lam(u) and the matrix T_lam(u) *)\ntLamAct[Gm_][lam_, u_][w_] := If[Max[lam, 0] == 0, w, Sum[t[[1]] Fold[#1 . tMat[Gm][t[[2, #2]]][u + hh (#2 - 1)] &, w, Range[Length[t[[2]]]]], {t, cbrTerms[lam]}]];\ntLamMat[Gm_][lam_, u_] := If[Max[lam, 0] == 0, tMat[Gm][0][u], Sum[t[[1]] (Dot @@ Table[tMat[Gm][t[[2, i]]][u + hh (i - 1)], {i, Length[t[[2]]]}]), {t, cbrTerms[lam]}]];\nclearMemo[f_] := (DownValues[f] = Select[DownValues[f], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]; SubValues[f] = Select[SubValues[f], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]);\nsetRep2[rep_] := (rep2 = rep; d2 = dim[rep]; clearMemo /@ {E2, Tu, TGm, tMat};);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* GT labels {{mu11},{mu21,mu12}}; lowest-weight vector; rotated vacuum for twist w *)\nClearAll[gtLabels, lwVec, gRot, vacCheck, locTest, runRep];\ngtLabels[rep_] := Flatten[Table[{{m11}, {m21, m12}}, {m11, rep[[2]], rep[[1]]}, {m12, rep[[3]], rep[[2]]}, {m21, m12, m11}], 2];\nlwVec[rep_] := UnitVector[dim[rep], First@FirstPosition[ps[{rep}], {{0}, {rep[[2]], 0}, rep}]];\ngRot[rep_, r_] := MatrixExp[r[[1]] JJ[2, 1, rep]] . MatrixExp[r[[2]] JJ[3, 1, rep]] . MatrixExp[r[[3]] JJ[3, 2, rep]];\n(* is the rotated vacuum a left eigenvector of t_1, t_2 with twist G_c(w)? (u generic) *)\nvacCheck[w_] := With[{vv = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[#, #]] &[lwVec[rep2] . gRot[rep2, rFromW[w]]], G = companion[w]}, AllTrue[{1, 2}, MatrixRank[{vv, vv . tMat[G][#][3/11]}] == 1 &]];\n(* <v| O_mu with the chain twist Gz; returns {label, rank of the d x d reshape, one-body with site 2 = original site-2 factor?} *)\nlocTest[vv_, site2_][lab : {{m11_}, {m21_, m12_}}] := Module[{x, den, m},\n   x = tLamAct[Gz][{m11, 0}, th[[1]]][tLamAct[Gz][{m21, m12}, th[[1]]][vv]];\n   den = tLamMat[Gz][{rep2[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]];\n   x = Quiet@Check[LinearSolve[Transpose[den], x], $Failed];\n   If[x === $Failed, {lab, \"T_{l2,0} singular\", \"-\"},\n    m = Select[ArrayReshape[Normal[x], {d2, d2}], Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &];\n    {lab, MatrixRank[m], m =!= {} && MatrixRank[Append[m, site2]] == 1}]];\n(* run one rep: rotated (twist w) and unrotated (control) vacua *)\nrunRep[rep_, w_] := Module[{s2, vW, v0, l0},\n   setRep2[rep];\n   s2 = lwVec[rep] . gRot[rep, rFromW[w]]; vW = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[s2, s2]];\n   l0 = lwVec[rep]; v0 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[l0, l0]];\n   <|\"rep\" -> rep, \"vac eigen for twist w\" -> vacCheck[w], \"rotated\" -> (locTest[vW, s2] /@ gtLabels[rep]), \"unrotated\" -> (locTest[v0, l0] /@ gtLabels[rep])|>];\nwv = {7/3, -1/2, 4};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* run per rep (adjoint ~0.1 s, [3,1,0] ~6 s, [3,2,0] ~9 s); list the labels mu whose O_mu localizes on site 1, and the reshape ranks on the rotated vacuum *)\nlocSummary[res_] := {res[\"vac eigen for twist w\"], Select[res[\"rotated\"], #[[3]] &][[All, 1]], Select[res[\"unrotated\"], #[[3]] &][[All, 1]], res[\"rotated\"][[All, 2]]};\nr210 = runRep[{2, 1, 0}, wv]; r310 = runRep[{3, 1, 0}, wv]; r320 = runRep[{3, 2, 0}, wv];\nGrid[Prepend[{#[\"rep\"], Sequence @@ locSummary[#]} & /@ {r210, r310, r320}, {\"rep\", \"vac eigen (twist w)\", \"localizing mu, rotated vac\", \"localizing mu, unrotated vac\", \"reshape ranks, rotated\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings (2026-09-29, point 1, $w=(7/3,-1/2,4)$, exact)\n\nLabels $\\{\\{\\mu_{11}\\},\\{\\mu_{21},\\mu_{12}\\}\\}$, $O_\\mu=\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{11},0}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}^{-1}\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{21},\\mu_{12}}$ at $\\theta_1$. \"Localizes\" = $\\langle v|O_\\mu=\\langle a|\\otimes\\langle\\text{site-2 vacuum}|$. The rotated vacuum is a left eigenvector of $t_1,t_2$ with twist $G_c(w)$ for every rep (sanity).\n\n| rep | rotated (twist-$w$) vacuum | unrotated $\\mathrm{lw}\\otimes\\mathrm{lw}$ (control) |\n|---|---|---|\n| $[2,1,0]$ | $1,\\ t_{11},\\ R\\,t_{11}$ | $1,\\ t_{11},\\ R,\\ R\\,t_{11}$ |\n| $[3,1,0]$ | $1,\\ t_{11},\\ \\tfrac{T_{20}}{T_{10}}t_{11},\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{10}}t_{11}$ | same $+\\ \\tfrac{T_{20}}{T_{10}},\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{10}}$ |\n| $[3,2,0]$ | $1,\\ t_{11},\\ T_{22},\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}}T_{22}$ | same $+\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}},\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}}t_{11}$ |\n\nPattern: on the rotated vacuum, the pure ratio $\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{11},0}/\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}$ stops localizing, but it still localizes when multiplied by the \"top\" column $\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,\\lambda_2}$ ($t_{11}$ for $\\lambda_2=1$, $T_{22}$ for $\\lambda_2=2$); for $\\lambda_2=2$ the ratio times $t_{11}$ fails. Everything else has reshape rank $>1$ (up to full rank $d$). $[4,2,0]$ not yet run (kernel stuck).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Irrep reach of the localizing operators on the twist-$w$ vacuum\nPreviously missed with the old full-$t$ pool (main-notes, summary table): $[3,1,0]^2$: $[3,3,2],[4,4,0]$; $[3,2,0]^2$: $[4,3,3]$ (reached only by $t_{22}t_{10}(\\theta_1+2h)$). Reach test as in \\nb{transfer-algebra-dim.wb}: irrep $\\rho$ is reached by $\\langle X|$ if $\\langle X|\\Pi(k)|\\mathrm{hw}_\\rho\\rangle\\neq0$ for a generic group element $k$; the number is the rank over the multiplicity space.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[opVec, irrepData, reachOf, reachTest];\n(* <v| O_mu, denominator T_{l2,0}(th1) factorised once per rep *)\nopVec[vv_, lsf_][{{m11_}, {m21_, m12_}}] := lsf[tLamAct[Gz][{m11, 0}, th[[1]]][tLamAct[Gz][{m21, m12}, th[[1]]][vv]]];\n(* hw vectors of V (x) V per dominant weight (computed inside each weight space), generic k (x) k *)\nirrepData[rep_] := Module[{d = dim[rep], E, EEr, wts, raise, doms, kmat},\n   E[i_, j_] := SparseArray[JJ[i, j, rep]];\n   EEr[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[E[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d, SparseArray], E[i, j]];\n   wts = Transpose[Diagonal /@ Table[Normal[EEr[i, i]], {i, 3}]];\n   raise = Join[EEr[1, 2], EEr[2, 3]];\n   doms = Select[Union[wts], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] &];\n   kmat = MatrixExp[2/3 JJ[2, 1, rep] - 1/2 JJ[3, 1, rep] + 3/5 JJ[3, 2, rep]] . MatrixExp[-1/4 JJ[1, 2, rep] + 2/7 JJ[1, 3, rep] + 1/3 JJ[2, 3, rep]];\n   <|\"hw\" -> Select[Association@Table[With[{idx = Flatten@Position[wts, mu]}, mu -> (Normal[SparseArray[Thread[idx -> #], d^2]] & /@ NullSpace[Normal[raise[[All, idx]]]])], {mu, doms}], # =!= {} &],\n     \"Pik\" -> KroneckerProduct[kmat, kmat]|>];\n(* irrep -> number of copies reached *)\nreachOf[X_, ird_] := Map[MatrixRank[{(X . ird[\"Pik\"]) . # & /@ #}] &, ird[\"hw\"]];\nreachTest[rep_, w_] := Module[{s2, vW, den, lsf, ird, labs, rows},\n   setRep2[rep];\n   s2 = lwVec[rep] . gRot[rep, rFromW[w]]; vW = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[s2, s2]];\n   den = tLamMat[Gz][{rep[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]]; lsf = LinearSolve[Transpose[den]];\n   ird = irrepData[rep];\n   (* keep only the labels whose O_mu is one-body with site 2 untouched *)\n   labs = Select[gtLabels[rep], With[{m = Select[ArrayReshape[Normal[opVec[vW, lsf][#]], {d2, d2}], Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &]}, m =!= {} && MatrixRank[Append[m, s2]] == 1] &];\n   rows = Table[{lab, reachOf[opVec[vW, lsf][lab], ird]}, {lab, labs}];\n   <|\"irreps (mult)\" -> Length /@ ird[\"hw\"], \"vacuum\" -> reachOf[vW, ird], \"ops\" -> rows,\n     \"missed by union\" -> Keys@Select[Merge[Append[rows[[All, 2]], reachOf[vW, ird]], Max], # == 0 &]|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ~6 s and ~20 s; rows = localizing O_mu on the twist-w vacuum, column = irreps it misses *)\nrt310 = reachTest[{3, 1, 0}, wv]; rt320 = reachTest[{3, 2, 0}, wv];\nGrid[Prepend[Join @@ Table[{rt[[1]], #[[1]], Keys@Select[#[[2]], # == 0 &]} & /@ rt[[2]][\"ops\"], {rt, {{\"[3,1,0]\", rt310}, {\"[3,2,0]\", rt320}}}], {\"rep\", \"mu\", \"irreps missed\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790500\" data-output-id=\"71\" data-out-n=\"39\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[39]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:37.2403em;vertical-align:-18.3501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:18.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-20.8501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.8501em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:37.2003em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-18.3501em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:18.8501em;\"><span style=\"top:-24.4601em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.6501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[3,1,0]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.4501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">[3,1,0]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" sty