   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: robustness and $[4,2,0]$ (2026-09-29)\n\n**Robustness.** Configurations (point, $w$, $k$): (1, $(7/3,-1/2,4)$, $k_1$) [original], (2, same $w$, $k_1$), (1, $(-5/2,3,1/5)$, $k_2$), (3, $(11/3,-2,5/7)$, $k_2$), (2, $(-5/2,3,1/5)$, $k_1$). For $[3,1,0]$ and $[3,2,0]$ (exact) the list of one-body $O_\\mu$ and their missed irreps is **identical** in all five; the vacuum is twist-$w$ eigen in each.\n\n**$[4,2,0]$** (mod $p$, $p=$ `NextPrime[10^9]`, `NextPrime[2 10^9]`; same five configurations, identical rows). One-body on the twist-$w$ vacuum: $1,\\ t_{11},\\ T_{22},\\ \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}}T_{22},\\ \\tfrac{T_{40}}{T_{20}}T_{22}$. Missed irreps: 12, 10, 7, $\\{[4,4,4],[6,6,0]\\}$, **none**.\n\nSo $O_{\\max}=\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,0}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}^{-1}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1)$ reaches every irrep for $[3,1,0],[3,2,0],[4,2,0]$, including the singlet analogue $[4,4,4]$ and $[6,6,0]$ that the old pool (depth 3 companion triples included) missed.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Single-site interpretation\nFor each one-body $\\langle v_g|O(\\theta_1)=\\langle a|\\otimes\\langle s|$ ($s=\\mathrm{lw}^Tg$), is $\\langle a| = c\\,\\langle s|O^{(L=1)}(\\theta_1)$, with $O^{(L=1)}$ the same combination built from the single-site-1 monodromy $\\mathcal L(u-\\theta_1)G_c(z)$ (same $h$, twist)? Exact.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Tu1, TGm1, qm1, tMat1, tLamAct1, tLamMat1, siteCompare];\n(* single-site (site 1) monodromy, same h, theta1, twist *)\nTu1[{i_, j_}][u_] := Tu1[{i, j}][u] = Ls[i, j][u - th[[1]]];\nTGm1[Gm_][{i_, j_}][u_] := TGm1[Gm][{i, j}][u] = Sum[Tu1[{i, k}][u] Gm[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\nqm1[Gm_][Ii_][u_] := Sum[Signature[p] (Dot @@ Table[TGm1[Gm][{p[[k]], Ii[[k]]}][u + hh - k hh], {k, Length[Ii]}]), {p, Permutations[Ii]}];\ntMat1[Gm_][a_][u_] := tMat1[Gm][a][u] = Which[a == 0, IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray], a < 0 || a > 3, SparseArray[{}, {d2, d2}], True, Sum[qm1[Gm][Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]];\ntLamAct1[Gm_][lam_, u_][w_] := If[Max[lam, 0] == 0, w, Sum[t[[1]] Fold[#1 . tMat1[Gm][t[[2, #2]]][u + hh (#2 - 1)] &, w, Range[Length[t[[2]]]]], {t, cbrTerms[lam]}]];\ntLamMat1[Gm_][lam_, u_] := If[Max[lam, 0] == 0, tMat1[Gm][0][u], Sum[t[[1]] (Dot @@ Table[tMat1[Gm][t[[2, i]]][u + hh (i - 1)], {i, Length[t[[2]]]}]), {t, cbrTerms[lam]}]];\n(* for each one-body label: {label, a proportional to s.O^(1)?, c = a / (s.O^(1))} *)\nsiteCompare[rep_, {pt_, w_}] := Module[{s2, vW, lsf, lsf1, labs, a, b, x, m, j0, c},\n   setPoint2[pts[pt]]; setRep2[rep]; clearMemo /@ {Tu1, TGm1, tMat1};\n   s2 = lwVec[rep] . gRot[rep, rFromW[w]]; vW = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[s2, s2]];\n   lsf = LinearSolve[Transpose[tLamMat[Gz][{rep[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]]]];\n   lsf1 = LinearSolve[Transpose[Normal@tLamMat1[Gz][{rep[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]]]];\n   j0 = First@FirstPosition[s2, x_ /; x != 0];\n   Table[x = opVec[vW, lsf][lab]; m = ArrayReshape[Normal[x], {d2, d2}];\n    If[MatrixRank[Append[Select[m, Max[Abs[#]] > 0 &], s2]] != 1, Nothing,\n     a = m[[All, j0]]/s2[[j0]];\n     b = lsf1[tLamAct1[Gz][{lab[[1, 1]], 0}, th[[1]]][tLamAct1[Gz][lab[[2]], th[[1]]][s2]]];\n     c = Union[DeleteCases[Quiet[a/b], Indeterminate | ComplexInfinity]];\n     {lab, MatrixRank[{a, Normal@b}] == 1 && Union[Flatten@Position[a, x_ /; x != 0]] === Union[Flatten@Position[Normal@b, x_ /; x != 0]], If[Length[c] == 1, Factor@First[c], c]}], {lab, gtLabels[rep]}]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* conjectured prefactor, x = theta1 - theta2: site-2 lowest-weight factor; checked below at points 1, 2 (point 3 with w1 = z2 is degenerate: bare ratios also localize) *)\ncPred[rep_, pt_] := With[{x = pts[pt][\"th\"][[1]] - pts[pt][\"th\"][[2]], h = pts[pt][\"h\"], l1 = rep[[1]], l2 = rep[[2]]}, With[{c11 = (x - l2 h) (x - h - l1 h)}, <|{{l2}, {0, 0}} -> 1, {{l2}, {1, 1}} -> c11, {{l2 + 1}, {1, 1}} -> c11 (x + h - l1 h), {{l2 + 2}, {1, 1}} -> c11 (x + h - l1 h) (x + 2 h - l1 h)|>]];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[With[{sc = siteCompare[rep, cf]}, {rep, cf, #[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3]], #[[3]] === cPred[rep, cf[[1]]][#[[1]]]} & /@ sc], {rep, {{2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}}}, {cf, {{1, {7/3, -1/2, 4}}, {1, {-5/2, 3, 1/5}}, {2, {7/3, -1/2, 4}}}}], 2], {\"rep\", \"{point, w}\", \"mu\", \"a = c s.O^(1)\", \"c\", \"c = formula\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790500\" data-output-id=\"73\" data-out-n=\"66\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[66]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:26.65em;vertical-align:-13.055em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.595em;\"><span style=\"top:-15.555em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:15.555em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:26.61em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-13.055em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:13.555em;\"><span style=\"top:-15.715em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.505em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"