  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: single-site interpretation (2026-09-29, exact)\n\nFor every one-body operator on the twist-$w$ vacuum ($[2,1,0]$: $1, t_{11}, Rt_{11}$; $[3,1,0]$: $1, t_{11}, \\tfrac{T_{20}}{T_{10}}t_{11}, \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{10}}t_{11}$)\n$$\\langle v_g|O(\\theta_1)=c_O\\;\\big(\\langle s|O^{(L=1)}(\\theta_1)\\big)\\otimes\\langle s|,$$\nwith $O^{(L=1)}$ the same CBR combination for the site-1 chain alone (same $h$, $\\theta_1$, twist $G_c(z)$). $c_O$ is independent of $w$ and of the twist, and is a product of site-2 lowest-weight factors, $x=\\theta_1-\\theta_2$, lowest weight $(0,\\lambda_2,\\lambda_1)$:\n- $t_{11}$: $c=(x-\\lambda_2h)(x-h-\\lambda_1h)$ (= $\\mathcal L_{22}(u)\\mathcal L_{33}(u-h)$ on lw);\n- each extra box $k=1,2,\\dots$ of $\\mathbb T_{\\mu_{11},0}/\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}$: factor $(x+kh-\\lambda_1h)$ (= $\\mathcal L_{33}(u+kh)$ on lw).\n\nChecked at points 1, 2 (two $w$ at point 1); point 3 with $w=(7/3,\\dots)$ has $w_1=z_2$, where the bare ratios also localize, with $c=(x-2h)$, $(x-2h)(x-h)$, same rule.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[cGen, siteCompareP];\n(* general prefactor: column T_{j,j} -> prod_i L22(u+ih) L33(u+ih-h) on lw; ratio T_{n,0}/T_{l2,0} -> prod_{k=l2}^{n-1} L33(u+kh) on lw *)\ncGen[rep_, pt_][{{m11_}, {j_, j_}}] := With[{x = pts[pt][\"th\"][[1]] - pts[pt][\"th\"][[2]], h = pts[pt][\"h\"], l1 = rep[[1]], l2 = rep[[2]]},\n   Product[(x + i h - l2 h) (x + i h - h - l1 h), {i, 0, j - 1}] Product[x + k h - l1 h, {k, l2, m11 - 1}]];\n(* mod-p two-site side, exact single-site side; returns {label, a == c_gen * s.O^(1) mod p} *)\nsiteCompareP[rep_, {pt_, w_}, labs_, p_] := Module[{s2, vW, denT, lsf1, j0},\n   setPoint2[pts[pt]]; setRep2[rep]; clearMemo /@ {Tu1, TGm1, tMat1};\n   s2 = lwVec[rep] . gRot[rep, rFromW[w]]; vW = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[s2, s2]];\n   denT = modPS[Transpose[SparseArray[tLamMat[Gz][{rep[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]]]], p];\n   lsf1 = LinearSolve[Transpose[Normal@tLamMat1[Gz][{rep[[2]], 0}, th[[1]]]]];\n   j0 = First@FirstPosition[s2, x_ /; x != 0];\n   Table[Module[{xp, m, a, b},\n     xp = LinearSolve[denT, modP[Normal[tLamAct[Gz][{lab[[1, 1]], 0}, th[[1]]][tLamAct[Gz][lab[[2]], th[[1]]][vW]]], p], Modulus -> p];\n     m = ArrayReshape[xp, {d2, d2}];\n     a = Mod[m[[All, j0]] PowerMod[modP[s2[[j0]], p], -1, p], p];\n     b = Normal@lsf1[tLamAct1[Gz][{lab[[1, 1]], 0}, th[[1]]][tLamAct1[Gz][lab[[2]], th[[1]]][s2]]];\n     {lab, MatrixRank[Append[Select[m, Max[#] > 0 &], modP[s2, p]], Modulus -> p] == 1, a === modP[cGen[rep, pt][lab] b, p]}], {lab, labs}]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ~30 s: [3,2,0] exact and [4,2,0] mod p at point 1; columns: label, one-body, a == c_gen s.O^(1) *)\nGrid[Prepend[Join[{\"[3,2,0] exact\", #[[1]], #[[2]], #[[3]] === cGen[{3, 2, 0}, 1][#[[1]]]} & /@ siteCompare[{3, 2, 0}, {1, {7/3, -1/2, 4}}], Prepend[#, \"[4,2,0] mod p\"] & /@ siteCompareP[{4, 2, 0}, {1, {7/3, -1/2, 4}}, labs420, primes[[1]]]], {\"rep\", \"mu\", \"one-body\", \"a = c_gen s.O^(1)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
