  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Findings: single-site interpretation for $\\lambda_2=2$ (2026-09-29)\n\n$[3,2,0]$ (exact; points 1, 2, two $w$): $1, t_{11}, T_{22}, \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}}T_{22}$ all equal $c_O\\,(\\langle s|O^{(L=1)})\\otimes\\langle s|$. $[4,2,0]$ (mod $p$, both primes; points 1, 2, 3, three $w$): same for $1, t_{11}, T_{22}, \\tfrac{T_{30}}{T_{20}}T_{22}, \\tfrac{T_{40}}{T_{20}}T_{22}$. The prefactor in all cases (all four reps) is\n$$c_{\\mathbb T_{n,0}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}^{-1}\\mathbb T_{j,j}}=\\prod_{i=0}^{j-1}(x+ih-\\lambda_2h)(x+ih-h-\\lambda_1h)\\ \\prod_{k=\\lambda_2}^{n-1}(x+kh-\\lambda_1h),\\qquad x=\\theta_1-\\theta_2,$$\ni.e. $\\mathcal L_{22}\\mathcal L_{33}$ per column box pair and $\\mathcal L_{33}$ per extra row box, on the site-2 lowest weight.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## $[4,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$ (dim 24): everything\nL=1 $B$-diagonalisation: \\nb{Companion-B-general-rep.wb} (24 eigvecs, rank 24). Here: localization + irrep reach (mod $p$) and single-site interpretation. Note: at point 1 the single-site $t_1(\\theta_1)$ is singular for $[4,1,0]$ (eigenvalue $z\\cdot m=0$ for weight $m=(3,2,0)$, $z=(2,-3,5)$), so the single-site comparison uses points 2, 3; the two-site $\\mathbb T_{1,0}(\\theta_1)$ is invertible at all points.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ~1 min: point-1 table; robustness over the 4 other configs (prime 2); single-site check at points 2,3, both primes *)\nbase410 = cfgRunP[{4, 1, 0}, {1, {7/3, -1/2, 4}, 1}, All, primes[[1]]][\"rows\"]; labs410 = base410[[All, 1]];\nrob410 = Table[cfgRunP[{4, 1, 0}, cf, All, primes[[2]]][\"rows\"] === base410, {cf, cfgs}];\nsite410 = Flatten@Table[siteCompareP[{4, 1, 0}, cf, labs410, pr][[All, 2 ;; 3]], {cf, {{2, {7/3, -1/2, 4}}, {2, {-5/2, 3, 1/5}}, {3, {11/3, -2, 5/7}}}}, {pr, primes}];\n{Grid[Prepend[{#[[1]], #[[3]]} & /@ base410, {\"mu (one-body)\", \"irreps of [4,1,0]^2 missed\"}], Frame -> All], \"robust over cfgs\" -> rob410, \"single-site with c_gen (all)\" -> And @@ site410}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
