pan class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.525em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:18.4901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">single-site with c_gen (all)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:17.6251em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[103]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu (one-body)} & \\text{irreps of [4,1,0]\\^{}2 missed}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{0,0\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}4 & 4 & 2\\\\5 & 3 & 2\\\\5 & 4 & 1\\\\5 & 5 & 0\\\\6 & 2 & 2\\\\6 & 3 & 1\\\\6 & 4 & 0\\\\7 & 2 & 1\\\\7 & 3 & 0\\\\8 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}4 & 4 & 2\\\\5 & 3 & 2\\\\5 & 4 & 1\\\\5 & 5 & 0\\\\6 & 2 & 2\\\\6 & 3 & 1\\\\6 & 4 & 0\\\\7 & 3 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}4 & 4 & 2\\\\5 & 3 & 2\\\\5 & 4 & 1\\\\5 & 5 & 0\\\\6 & 4 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{3\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\begin{pmatrix}4 & 4 & 2\\\\5 & 5 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{\\left\\{4\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\{\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{robust over cfgs}\\to \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{single-site with c\\_gen (all)}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c10f3e7c-9c39-493a-be4f-6a0e6d98ca21"
    }
