  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Is $O_{\\max}$ a polynomial transfer matrix? Compare with $\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1+sh)$\nQuestion (Paul): is $O_{\\max}=\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,0}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}^{-1}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1)$ proportional to $\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1+sh)$ for some shift $s$? Since all the $\\mathbb T$'s commute, the operator statement is $\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,0}\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1)=c\\,\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_2,0}(\\theta_1)\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1+sh)$. Also test the weaker statement on the twist-$w$ vacuum only: $\\langle v_g|O_{\\max}\\propto\\langle v_g|\\mathbb T_{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2}(\\theta_1+sh)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[polyTest];\n(* for each shift s: {s, operator identity T_{l1,0}T_{l2,l2} = c T_{l2,0} T_{l1,l2}(th1+s h)?, vacuum-level proportionality <v|O_max ~ <v|T_{l1,l2}(th1+s h)?} *)\npolyTest[rep_, pt_, w_, shifts_] := Module[{l1 = rep[[1]], l2 = rep[[2]], u, A, den, s2, vW, xO, flat},\n   setPoint2[pts[pt]]; setRep2[rep]; u = th[[1]];\n   A = tLamMat[Gz][{l1, 0}, u] . tLamMat[Gz][{l2, l2}, u]; den = tLamMat[Gz][{l2, 0}, u];\n   s2 = lwVec[rep] . gRot[rep, rFromW[w]]; vW = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[s2, s2]];\n   xO = LinearSolve[Transpose[den], tLamAct[Gz][{l1, 0}, u][tLamAct[Gz][{l2, l2}, u][vW]]];\n   flat[m_] := Flatten[Normal[m]];\n   Table[With[{Tp = tLamMat[Gz][{l1, l2}, u + s hh]}, {s, MatrixRank[{flat[A], flat[den . Tp]}] == 1, MatrixRank[{Normal@xO, Normal[vW . Tp]}] == 1}], {s, shifts}]];\npt310 = polyTest[{3, 1, 0}, 1, {7/3, -1/2, 4}, Range[-3, 3]];\nGrid[Prepend[pt310, {\"s\", \"operator: T30 T11 = c T10 T31(th1+s h)\", \"vacuum: <v|O_max ~ <v|T31(th1+s h)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790500\" data-output-id=\"77\" data-out-n=\"107\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"26\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[107]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\