\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.8277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[116]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rep} & \\text{n} & \\text{u} & \\text{identity holds} & \\text{difference \\textasciitilde{} T\\_\\{n,l2,1\\}(u)?}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\} & 2 & \\frac{3}{11} & \\mathrm{False} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\} & 3 & \\frac{3}{11} & \\mathrm{False} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1,0\\right\\} & 3 & \\frac{2007}{7000} & \\mathrm{False} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\end{array} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\text{k with t3(th1+k h)=0, [3,1,0] (two-site)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\left\\{0,2\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "183bc803-17e6-4664-ae03-2b0e71ee10d5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* at generic u: is T_{n,0}T_{m,m} - T_{m,0}T_{n,m} = c t3(u + a h) T_{n-1,m-1}(u + b h)?  scan a, b; generic u = 3/11 *)\nClearAll[qdetFit];\nqdetFit[rep_, n_, u_] := Module[{m = rep[[2]], D},\n   setPoint2[pts[1]]; setRep2[rep];\n   D = Flatten@Normal[tLamMat[Gz][{n, 0}, u] . tLamMat[Gz][{m, m}, u] - tLamMat[Gz][{m, 0}, u] . tLamMat[Gz][{n, m}, u]];\n   Select[Flatten[Table[{a, b, MatrixRank[{D, Flatten@Normal[tMat[Gz][3][u + a hh] . tLamMat[Gz][{n - 1, m - 1}, u + b hh]]}] == 1}, {a, 0, 2}, {b, -1, 2}], 1], Last]];\nqf = {qdetFit[{2, 1, 0}, 2, 3/11], qdetFit[{3, 1, 0}, 3, 3/11]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"790500\" data-output-id=\"80\" data-out-n=\"119\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"29\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[119]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x7XH0sXHtcfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
