  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Same ranks as the lowest-weight test in the $\\langle\\mathrm{lw}|$ frame, as expected under $w_0$. Every covector is exactly $\\langle v'|\\otimes\\langle e_1|$, and the ranks on highest-weight states are $[2,2,2],[3,2,1],[3,3,0],[4,1,1],[4,2,0]\\to 1,2,1,\\mathbf 0,1$: the $10$ is missed, and the singlet and both octets are reached. The singlet agrees with every earlier test because $\\Pi(k)$ acts trivially on it. For the other irreps the old generic-$k$ \"reach\" is a weaker statement (any component in the multiplet), and it does not contradict this.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
